@baseUrl = http://localhost:5103

### Создать правило SLA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{"priority":"high","resolutionMinutes":90}

### Создать обращение
# @name ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Cannot sign in","priority":"high"}

### Перевести в работу
# @name inProgress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticket.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"InProgress","version":"{{ticket.response.body.$.version}}"}

### Устаревшая версия: 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticket.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Resolved","version":"{{ticket.response.body.$.version}}"}

### Завершить с актуальной версией
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticket.response.body.$.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Resolved","version":"{{inProgress.response.body.$.version}}"}

### Просроченные обращения
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/overdue
